        "TileImage": "$($repository e1c8c0a5-a506-45b6-9567-7b6df50b8877).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, Agent 47.\r\rYour target is Omar Al-Ghazali, the owner of the Burj Al-Ghazali located in Dubai, UAE. You have been there before to eliminate Providence Partners Carl Ingram and Marcus Stuyvesant. Now, Marcus&apos; daughter, Cornelia, believes that Omar has obtained his riches illegally by selling oil on the black market. Hence, she has hired us to eliminate him at any cost, but she has one condition: you have to eliminate him with perfection.\r\rGood luck.",
